  "description": "Step into this beautifully presented 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom, 2-car garage family home, perfectly designed for comfortable modern living. Offering a clever layout and stylish features, this home is ideal for families, couples, or professionals seeking space and convenience.<br/><br/>Bedrooms:<br/>Two of the bedrooms are equipped with built-in wardrobes and are serviced by the central family bathroom, complete with a shower. The master suite is a true retreat, carpeted for comfort and featuring a generous walk-in wardrobe and a private ensuite - perfect for relaxing after a busy day.<br/><br/>Additional Multi-Purpose Room:<br/>A separate versatile room provides the flexibility to suit your lifestyle. Whether you need a media room, rumpus room, home office, study, children's playroom, or even a guest retreat, this additional space offers endless possibilities.<br/><br/>Living & Dining:<br/>The open-plan living and dining area is bright and inviting, creating the perfect space for family gatherings, entertaining friends, or simply enjoying everyday life.<br/><br/>Kitchen:<br/>The modern kitchen is a chef's delight, with plenty of storage, bench space, and room to prepare meals with ease. Its contemporary design blends seamlessly with the living and dining areas.<br/><br/>Additional Features:<br/>Double remote garage<br/>Separate laundry<br/>Functional and family-friendly floor plan<br/>Spacious living areas<br/>Low-maintenance lifestyle<br/><br/>Location Highlights:<br/>Nestled in the sought-after suburb of Butler, this home enjoys a convenient location close to a range of amenities, including:<br/><br/>Minutes from Butler Train Station for an easy commute to Perth CBD<br/>Close to Butler Central Shopping Centre, supermarkets, cafés, and everyday conveniences<br/>Nearby quality schools, including Butler College and East Butler Primary School<br/>Easy access to local parks, playgrounds, and family-friendly recreational areas<br/>Short drive to the stunning Butler and Jindalee beaches<br/>Convenient access to Marmion Avenue and the Mitchell Freeway<br/>Surrounded by local restaurants, medical facilities, and community amenities<br/><br/>Don't miss this opportunity to make 31 Hollyford Parade, Butler your next home - a space where style, comfort, flexibility, and convenience come together beautifully.<br/><br/>Don't delay, as these homes are - Sure to Rent Quickly!<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>This information is provided for general information purposes only and is based on information provided by the Seller and may be subject to change. No warranty or representation is made as to its accuracy and interested parties should place no reliance on it and should make their own independent enquiries.",
